.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-runner-controller-token-list \- List tokens for a runner controller. (EXPERIMENTAL)


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab runner-controller token list  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Lists tokens for the given runner controller. Token values are not shown.

.PP
This feature is an experiment and is not ready for production use.
It might be unstable or removed at any time.
For more information, see
https://docs.gitlab.com/policy/development_stages_support/.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json.

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--page\fP=1
	Page number.

.PP
\fB-P\fP, \fB--per-page\fP=30
	Number of items per page.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# List all tokens for runner controller 42
glab runner-controller token list 42

# List tokens as JSON
glab runner-controller token list 42 --output json
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-runner-controller-token(1)\fP
